// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2922039716" "One of my heroes found this broken piece of stone while he was stopping a Banished Pantheon plot. It looks familiar, and I need to find out more about it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you take the artifact piece to Azuria?</A> I'd really like to have her opinion."
// AcceptString :
"P137855022" "Take the artifact piece to Azuria"
// SendOffString :
"P1114461727" "My instincts tell me that this thing is important. Watch out for trouble."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2693370440" "Deliver artifact to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1995900328" "Get that relic piece over to Azuria as fast as possible."
// TaskTitle :
"P1742599466" "<color deepskyblue>The Wheel of Destruction</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

