"P1906569314" "Where did you find this? It appears to be one of the pieces of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}! You are meant to keep this, {HeroName}. Do not question me; many villains in Paragon City would kill to have the fully assembled {Artifact_Name}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P632071904" "If Azuria said you are meant to hold onto it, then that is what you should do. She is never wrong about things like that."

