"P1513262820" "Looks like the Warriors are at it again. They've broken into the warehouse where the museum was storing next month's feature exhibit. Whatever they're looking for, we need to keep it out of their hands. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please go stop the Warriors from stealing the museum's artifacts.</A>"
