// Dialog :
"P604274805" "I will put some of our most talented mystics to work studying these pieces of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}. If we need further assistance from you, I will make sure you are contacted. You can rest assured that the {ARTIFACT_NAME} will be carefully warded against further incursions by the Banished Pantheon."

