// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1421784600" "You look like you could use an easy task, {HeroName}. After all your work retrieving the pieces of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}, you deserve it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Hey, could you patrol Independence Port for me?</A> The Family has been extorting protection money out of the business owners over there."
// AcceptString :
"P1022985349" "Patrol Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P1297957831" "Thanks again for all the help you've been giving me, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3536492535" "Patrol, stop Family extortion"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3078128906" "Some of those patrol boxes still haven't been checked."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1645354397" "I just got a call from MAGI's Divinations group. The Banished Pantheon broke into their vault and stole those artifact pieces you collected! According to the seers, the Pantheon plans to perform a ritual to empower and assemble the {ARTIFACT_NAME}. You have to stop the ritual!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4244859160" "I have MAGI scrying for the current location of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2072437814" "We have to recover those relic pieces the Banished Pantheon stole from MAGI. Otherwise, they'll assemble the {ARTIFACT_NAME} and empower it!<br><br>MAGI's seers have pinpointed the location where the Pantheon is trying to empower the pieces, under the direction of a cultist called Archos. I'm counting on you to prevent the Banished Pantheon from completing this ritual, {HeroName}.<br><br><color orange>You only have 90 minutes to stop the ritual.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1640058941" "Prevent the Banished Pantheon from completing the ritual"
// SendOffString :
"P1201964477" "According to my sources, the ritual is taking place in the old <color deepskyblue>Shady Pines Graveyard</color>. I've called for an emergency force field to lock the situation down until you arrive. The Pantheon may have already empowered the pieces of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}, but the assembly should take a while. To stop them, you need to find all the pieces of the {ARTIFACT_NAME}.<br><br><color orange>You're going to have to take the train to get there. Go to any train station and select Shady Pines Graveyard as your destination.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P645104914" "Defeat Archos and his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3655780073" "You've got to stop the ritual to empower the {ARTIFACT_NAME}!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

